{"id":"vod_md_2734","vodId":"2734","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"机动战士高达00","name_cn":"机动战士高达00","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230818-1/837450a5cd2d42ff7bd3aff13fdedcee.jpg"},"summary":"公元2307年，地球的化石燃料枯竭了。经过将近半个世纪的建设后，建成了全长5万千米、以3条轨道升降机为中心的太阳能发电系统。为了建造出这个能制造半永久能量的巨大建筑物，世界形成了3个巨大的国家联盟：以美国为中心的“世界经济联盟”，通称UNION；以中国、俄罗斯、印度为中心的“人类革新联盟”；新欧洲共同体AEU。由于轨道升降机过于巨大，防卫变成了十分困难的任务。但各国军队依然为了自己的威信与繁荣进行着大规模的zero-sum game（任何一方都得不到好处的竞争）。这样的世界，要为其花上句号的组织出现了——拥有机动战士高达的“天人”私人武装组织。他们为了消除世界的纷争，展开了超越民族、国家、宗教的作战行动。高达驾驶员刹那•F•清英决心改变这个世界。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-18 08:40:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/FPz2nTK7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/HGy9AIFM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/cMSwDN2F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/sza8zLdX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/uEDp4nml/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/Ks0sBvdk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/uV8OL8oT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/vnALfPY1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/cm3mTLNc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/uKPl6KWk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/WDivO3SI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/fs5RvTKv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/zzBL48wm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/xUTFTuLi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx